{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>劉浩龍《UNITED IN HEARTS 劉浩龍2027澳門演唱會》將於2027年2月13日在「澳門百老匯」-百老匯舞台舉行，即刻看內文了解如何搶飛、場地座位表及交通！</p><figure><img alt=\"劉浩龍《UNITED IN HEARTS 劉浩龍2027澳門演唱會》海報（IG@chessman_macau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200027724819730432968310.jpeg/arAeIp8_vGxorAjw4__pTuHABuCLI9v1N8dXwDfHV8A\"/><figcaption>劉浩龍《UNITED IN HEARTS 劉浩龍2027澳門演唱會》海報（IG@chessman_macau）</figcaption></figure><p>劉浩龍演唱會2027澳門 | 詳情</p><p>演唱會日期：2027年2月13日\n演唱會時間：晚上8點\n演唱會地點：「澳門百老匯」-百老匯舞台\n門票價錢：待公佈</p><figure><img alt=\"劉浩龍（IG@boomboom_hk_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200027868294287360369170.jpeg/xbvqm_SGsbqyNdS2aM61rMsR-qGJi3QMJH7W8yR-1vM\"/><figcaption>劉浩龍（IG@boomboom_hk_official）</figcaption></figure><p>劉浩龍演唱會2027澳門 | 公開發售</p><p>公開發售平台 ：待公佈\n公開開賣日期：待公佈\n公開開賣時間：待公佈</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.560317+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":2,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:28:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:17:28.581217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:32.257092+00:00","content_hash":"3c1b5ccd9961ac78ca9baf880e08a1689fd87baf88b3364095a7a0a8f0d44600","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}